1
00:00:07,107 --> 00:00:07,874
Ethan@Your room is very girly.

2
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:10,610
Emily@What are you talking about?

3
00:00:12,812 --> 00:00:13,546
Ethan@Well... it smells nice.

4
00:00:18,251 --> 00:00:19,219
Ethan@You're reading books too?

5
00:00:21,187 --> 00:00:21,955
Emily@Yes, I am.

6
00:00:22,989 --> 00:00:24,424
Ethan@I really like the author of this book.

7
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:26,893
Emily@I know.

8
00:00:27,494 --> 00:00:28,061
Ethan@You know?

9
00:00:32,565 --> 00:00:33,733
Ethan@What other books do you read?

10
00:00:35,468 --> 00:00:35,935
Ethan@What's wrong?

11
00:00:37,937 --> 00:00:38,705
Emily@Nothing.

12
00:00:41,674 --> 00:00:42,942
Ethan@You keep a handwritten diary?

13
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:44,110
Ethan@Aren't many people forgetting how to write characters these days?

14
00:00:46,212 --> 00:00:46,613
Emily@Yeah, that's true.

15
00:00:46,613 --> 00:00:47,247
Ethan@Let me take a look.

16
00:00:48,648 --> 00:00:49,082
Emily@No, not yet!

17
00:00:50,316 --> 00:00:52,218
Emily@It's just my random scribblings.

18
00:00:53,853 --> 00:00:54,554
Ethan@Is that so?

19
00:00:54,954 --> 00:00:56,089
Ethan@How mysterious.

20
00:00:56,723 --> 00:00:57,924
Emily@There's nothing special in it.

21
00:00:59,025 --> 00:00:59,793
Ethan@Alright then.

22
00:01:03,663 --> 00:01:04,631
Ethan@So, what are you going to do later?

23
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:08,201
Emily@Later... I don't have any plans.

24
00:01:11,871 --> 00:01:12,539
Ethan@What's this?

25
00:01:21,181 --> 00:01:22,048
@Ethan, do you know? You're the last person I think about before I sleep and the first thing I think of when I wake up. Thank you for always being there for me when I'm down. I've started to get used to having you around, so I want to ask you something!

26
00:01:55,815 --> 00:01:56,683
Ethan@Actually, I also...

27
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:00,553
Ethan@No, wait.

28
00:02:01,221 --> 00:02:02,422
Ethan@I, I, I wasn't sure before.

29
00:02:05,291 --> 00:02:05,792
Ethan@Do, do you like me too?

30
00:02:10,330 --> 00:02:11,564
Ethan@Anyway, thank you.

31
00:02:11,931 --> 00:02:12,932
Ethan@Thank you for liking me too.

32
00:02:19,839 --> 00:02:20,740
Ethan@I think it's about time.

33
00:02:22,609 --> 00:02:22,942
Ethan@I, I should go now.

34
00:02:25,278 --> 00:02:26,579
Ethan@Let's meet again next time.

35
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:29,482
Emily@Wait a moment.

36
00:02:34,087 --> 00:02:36,389
Emily@Can you stay with me a little longer?

37
00:03:41,221 --> 00:03:41,988
Emily@Is that okay?

